routing.home-meals-list-builder:
# AGENTS

When the plan needs an ingredient the shop will not have:
  @Menu Planner, please confirm whether the substitute changes the meal.
When the pantry quantity is an estimate rather than a count:
  @Pantry Checker, please confirm this one before I put it on the list.

routing.home-meals-menu-planner:
# AGENTS

When the plan needs to know what is in the house:
  @Pantry Checker, please confirm what is on hand and what needs using first.
When the plan is set and the gaps need buying:
  @Shopping List Builder, please turn the difference between plan and pantry into one list.

routing.home-meals-pantry-checker:
# AGENTS

When the pantry picture is ready:
  @Menu Planner, please build the week around this, starting with the use-first list.
When a staple is finished rather than low:
  @Shopping List Builder, please put this on the list as a definite rather than a maybe.
